# ERC-20 Token Wallet

## Project Description
This project is a simple ERC-20 token wallet
developed using Solidity.

## Features
- Check token balance
- Transfer tokens
- Validate wallet address
- Prevent transfer when balance is insufficient

## Technology Used
- Solidity
- Ethereum Blockchain
- GitHub

## Main Functions
- balanceOf()
- transfer()

## Token Details
Token Name: MyToken
Token Symbol: MTK
Initial Supply: 1000 MTK
